{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_14","type":"agent_message","text":"The focused regression suite passed. I found a gap in R2’s guard: it treats any `More()` call as an end check, but Go’s `More()` returns false for trailing `}` or `]`, allowing malformed input through an otherwise plausible reader. I’m also checking a mismatch in the artifact command’s reported revision before using its result as evidence.\n"}}
